      "dct:description": "Terms for SBRM metamodel elements (metamodel.xmi, version 20241101) that the SBRM OWL ontologies do not define. Each term keeps the exact metamodel name as its label and cites the xmi:id of the element it stands for. SBRM ontology terms used directly are annotated with the metamodel element they correspond to.",
